WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.500
Everything is made of tiny particles, with empty space between them.

2
00:00:05.301 --> 00:00:09.751
Zoom in on ice: particles packed in a pattern, vibrating in place.

3
00:00:11.785 --> 00:00:15.485
In water they are still close, but slide past each other.

4
00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:21.642
In steam they are far apart and fast, with empty space between.

5
00:00:22.318 --> 00:00:27.168
The particles are the same in all three; only arrangement and motion change.
